          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A gesture of goodwill and brotherhood: Sheikh Mohammed Obaid, Honorary Consul General for Sri Lanka, receives a donation of US $62,000 for the construction of permanent accommodation for Sri Lankan tsunami victims from Shamsh Kassim-Lakha, President of Aga Khan University, on March 5, 2005 in Karachi. This contribution was a result of the donation of one day's salary by the faculty and staff of the University."
